DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'PGML.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');

Context('Numeric');

$percent = random(1, 7.5, 0.5);
$A2      = Compute("100sqrt(1-$percent/100)");

BEGIN_PGML

a)  What is the effect on the period of a pendulum if you double its length?

    The period increases by a factor of [_]{Compute("sqrt(2)")} 

b) Of what percent of its original period is its new period if a pendulum's length is decreased by [`[$percent] \textrm{%}`]?

    [_]{$A2} [`\textrm{%}`] 

END_PGML

BEGIN_PGML_HINT
To what power is the length parameter raised in the formula relating the period of a simple pendulum to its length?
END_PGML_HINT

ENDDOCUMENT();
